# Mana Barracks of the Thousand produced is told apart from other mana (CR 106.3): with a {W} from it and a {W} from a Plains
# in the pool, a spell costing {W} is paid with whichever its controller chooses (CR 601.2h, 118.3a), offered as two kinds of
# {W}. On turn 5 Bot1 pays Authority of the Consuls with the Plains' {W} (`Spend: W`), keeping the Barracks',
# which then casts Healer's Hawk: a Gnome Soldier. On turn 9 Bot1 pays the second Authority with the Barracks' {W}
# (`Spend: W from Barracks of the Thousand`), so the Hawk is cast with the Plains' and makes none; the Plains is tapped first
# then, so the mana that came first is not what the choice takes.

